Comment: 1,0:01:38.14,0:01:40.57,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,梦想受到束缚
Comment: 1,0:01:41.10,0:01:43.28,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,沉重命运的意志
Comment: 1,0:01:43.60,0:01:46.70,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,如同被压迫直至覆灭
Comment: 1,0:01:48.63,0:01:51.07,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,前方已无处逃避
Comment: 1,0:01:51.37,0:01:53.66,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,唯有挣扎着前行
Comment: 1,0:01:54.02,0:01:57.84,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是我永远不会放弃
Comment: 1,0:01:57.89,0:02:03.81,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,瓦砾之中埋藏的
Comment: 1,0:02:03.95,0:02:08.87,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,希望的碎片
Comment: 1,0:02:09.65,0:02:14.43,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,用这双手 将它们找寻
Comment: 1,0:02:14.52,0:02:19.94,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,只为改变这世间
Comment: 1,0:02:22.63,0:02:25.30,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,Fighting Gold
Comment: 1,0:02:25.36,0:02:35.07,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,唯有相信自己的内心之人 终有一天方能闪耀
Comment: 1,0:02:35.71,0:02:43.96,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,燃烧全部生命 即便是神亦无畏惧 战斗永不停息
Comment: 1,0:02:44.20,0:02:48.68,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,不屈的魂灵
Comment: 1,0:02:51.42,0:02:54.10,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,Fighting Gold
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.02,0:01:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 2,0:01:38.14,0:01:40.57,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,夢を縛り付ける
Comment: 2,0:01:41.10,0:01:43.28,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,重たい運命の石に
Comment: 2,0:01:43.60,0:01:46.70,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,まるで押し潰されて
Comment: 2,0:01:48.63,0:01:51.07,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,どこにも逃げられない
Comment: 2,0:01:51.37,0:01:53.66,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,ひたすら足掻きながら
Comment: 2,0:01:54.02,0:01:57.84,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,だけど諦めない
Comment: 2,0:01:57.89,0:02:03.81,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,瓦礫の底に埋もれた
Comment: 2,0:02:03.95,0:02:08.87,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,希望の欠片たち
Comment: 2,0:02:09.65,0:02:14.43,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,きっとこの手で 見つけ出すさ
Comment: 2,0:02:14.52,0:02:19.94,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,世界を変えるために
Comment: 2,0:02:25.36,0:02:35.07,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,自分のうちを信じた者だけがいつか輝ける
Comment: 2,0:02:35.71,0:02:43.96,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,生命の限り 神にも逆らい 闘い続ける
Comment: 2,0:02:44.20,0:02:48.68,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,不屈の魂たちよ
